\newlabel{fig:protocol}{{5}{13}{Prespecification and confirmation protocol. An earlier-simulator calibration with four seeds selected $\lambda =0.3$ for the centered full-action objective before the current synthetic experiment. Other auxiliary objectives inherited this coefficient without method-specific tuning. Twenty disjoint confirmation seeds, 800--819, are each evaluated on 20 shared held-out traces in seven regimes, with no current-generator tuning or seed exclusion.\relax }{figure.caption.9}{}}
